WEBVTT

00:00:00.013 --> 00:00:06.557
Parameter-efficient fine-tuning libraries provide implementations of low rah and related approaches.

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:13.657
A small configuration can control adapter rank, scaling, dropout, and task type.

00:00:13.657 --> 00:00:21.772
The correct target modules still depend on the architecture, so do not copy one configuration blindly across every

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:26.812
model. low rah rank and target modules affect both training cost and adaptation capacity,

00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:32.532
so they should be treated as experiment settings rather than magic defaults.
